      "index": "b0C",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "• KafkaConsumer<Long, StatusMessage>\n  (specific.avro.reader=true, poll 1000ms)\n• Key: LongDeserializer\n• Val: SafeStatusMessageDeserializer\n  (wraps KafkaAvroDeserializer -> :8081)\n• If parse fails: attaches dlq-error &\n  dlq-raw-payload headers, returns null\n  (prevents poison-pill crash in poll())\n• Adaptive Backpressure:\n  pause() at >=80% queue, resume() at <=50%",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 278102123,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "• KafkaConsumer<Long, StatusMessage>\n  (specific.avro.reader=true, poll 1000ms)\n• Key: LongDeserializer\n• Val: SafeStatusMessageDeserializer\n  (wraps KafkaAvroDeserializer -> :8081)\n• If parse fails: attaches dlq-error &\n  dlq-raw-payload headers, returns null\n  (prevents poison-pill crash in poll())\n• Adaptive Backpressure:\n  pause() at >=80% queue, resume() at <=50%",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1795695499786,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1159547455,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
